:: OC Isaiah and Shinju Intro [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 2>>
You’re standing inside one of the stalls, minding your business. The bathroom is quiet, with only the echo of muffled voices from the hallway, when the door creaks open and you hear someone walk inside. You freeze, your own stream stopping just in time to hide your presence, as you listen to them walk up to the sink and hear a familiar voice. <br>
<<needChange "Bladder" 100>>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "OC Zay",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Uniform",
            Mouth: "Happy",
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

Curious, you peek through the stall crack <span style="Color: Pink">and spot <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> fixing his hair while giggling and talking to himself. It’s a cute sight of boyish fun and you decide to quickly finish up and walk out to greet him</span><span style="Color: LightCoral"> when all of a sudden the bathroom door slams open!</span> <br>
<br>
A couple more footsteps quickly fill the room. You tilt your head and see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span> and two other of Xavier’s goons behind him. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, well, well. The wanna-be popstar, all alone.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span> chuckles. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> <span style="Color: Yellow">instantly straightens, glancing around the group with a smile.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wow, you needed three of you to sneak me in the bathroom?”</span> He says. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span>”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span> smirks and rolls his sleeves while the other boys walk over towards <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span>, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“consider this to be a learning opportunity on how things work around here.”</span> <br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "OC Zay",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Uniform",
            Eyes: "Tired",
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> doesn’t flinch, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Lemme guess, fat boy, you’re gonna sit on me and squish me to death?”</span> <span style="Color: Yellow">He mocks, causing one of the goons to shove <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> hard against the wall. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> quickly kicks the boy right between his legs, causing him to cry out in pain and drop to the floor. At the same time, you see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> quickly throw a connecting left-handed swing at the other goon, causing him to stumble back. He then tries to throw another punch at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span>, but he manages to dodge and counter <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> with a punch of his own.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightCoral"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> is sent stumbling back into the sink, his arm knocking over the soap dispenser! You feel a pit in your stomach as this just got a lot more violent than an average middle school ribbing. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> tries to steady himself, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span> throws a couple more punches, which causes <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> to slip on the soap dripping down and fall to the floor. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span> and the other boys move in fast, starting to punch and kick the grounded <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span>.</span> You’re standing frozen in the stall, heart pounding as you work up the nerve to jump in… <span style="Color: Yellow">when the door creaks open again!</span> <br>
<br>

<<linkreplace"Continue">>
    Everyone stops, the room going still. Only the footsteps from the door break the silence until <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“…you shouldn’t have done that.”</span> A voice, low and soft. <span style="Color: LightGreen">You turn and see Shinju standing there with his hands on his hips.</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "OC Zay",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Uniform",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Eyes: "Closed",
                    Blush: 3,
                    Cry: 2,
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC Shinju",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Uniform",
                    Eyes: "Mad",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

    <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span> scoffs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Who the fuck let the weird ghost boy in here?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span> grabs <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> by his hair and points at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>. The other boys start walking towards <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>, who simply takes a step forward without fear. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You want to butt your nose in where it doesn’t belong? Fine! We’ll teach you!”</span> <br>
    <br>
    But before Xavier’s goons can react, <span style="Color: LightGreen"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> grabs the boy’s wrist and yanks him into the stall door next to yours with a loud bang.</span> You jump from the sudden impact. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span>’s attention is now on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>, <span style="Color: LightGreen">so he doesn’t notice as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> uses the opening to slam his elbow into <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span>’s gut,</span> causing the boy to stumble back and release him. <br>
    <br>
    <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> seemed ready for this, tripping the stumbling <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span> to the floor as he holds down the thrown goon. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> <span style="Color: LightGreen">then pounces and starts wailing on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span>, the battle now completely in their favor.</span> <span style="Color: Yellow">As this is going on, you notice the boy who got kicked in the balls is almost recovered, looking to strike and make it three on two!</span> <br>
    <br>
    <div id="choice">
        <<link "Join the Fight<br>">>
        <<replace"#choice">>
            <span style="Color: LightGreen">As the boy gets up from the floor and starts charging at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span>, you burst through the bathroom stall and charge at him, grabbing his arm and yanking him back! But the boy spins you off of him, turning to deliver a punch directly into your chin! But before he makes contact, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> suddenly appears and delivers his own right into the side of the kid’s head, sending him crashing into the paper towel dispenser.</span> <br>

                <<set _ad to [
                    {
                        Name: "OC Zay",
                        State: {
                            Outfit: "Uniform",
                            Eyes: "Mad",
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        Name: "OC Shinju",
                        State: {
                            Outfit: "Uniform",
                            Mouth: "Smirk",
                            Eyes: "Tired",
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        Name: "Player",
                        State: {
                            Eyes: "Mad",
                            Blush: 1,
                        },
                    },
                ]>>
                <<ad _ad>>

            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Thanks, brother, for helping out.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> says with a smile. You both turn back to the fight to see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span> throwing a wild punch at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>, but he easily ducks under it then shoves his palm straight into <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span>’s chest, sending him slipping on the wet floor and hitting the tiles with a nasty thud. <span style="Color: LightGreen">Now all of Xavier’s goons are on the ground, groaning.</span> <br>
            <br>
            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Ya’ll want some more!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> yells. <span style="Color: LightGreen">The defeated goons get up and slowly scramble, tossing curses and threats as they drag each other towards the exit.</span> You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> take a minute to catch your breath, though <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> barely seems winded. He is just staring at the mirror, whispering something to himself. <br>
            <<socialChange "Zay" 3 1>>
            <br>
            <<linkreplace"Continue">>
                <<include"Isaiah and Shinju Intro 2">>
            <</linkreplace>>
        <</replace>>
        <</link>>
        <<link "Don’t move<br>">>
        <<replace"#choice">>
            You don’t move, still watching through the stall crack. <span style="Color: LightCoral">You see the boy push <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> off of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span>, making him hit the side of the sink. He then grabs and pulls <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> off of the other goon while <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jake</span> rushes out of the bathroom, taking his chance to escape.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> manages to break free and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> gets back on his feet. All 4 remaining boys are now on their feet, waiting for the others to make a move. <br>
            <br>
            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yo, we still doing this!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> yells. All four boys are panting, trying to catch their breath. Then Xavier’s goons look at each other and at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>, their leader gone and the odds now even. They start slowly backing out of the room, though continue to hurl threats as they retreat. The door shuts behind them and the room goes silent once again. You slowly and nervously open your stall. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> turns to you suddenly, wondering if you’re another threat, but sighs as he just sees you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, I’m soooo glad that you finally show your face.”</span> <span style="Color: LightCoral">He says sarcastically as you feel a little bad for not stepping in to help.</span> <br>
            <<socialChange "Zay" -5 1>>
