:: Isaiah and Shinju Intro 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> leans against the sink, still catching his breath, as you stand nearby glancing at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> as he drifts towards the center of the room. Then, without looking up, he speaks. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sooo… you <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> Miller?”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> raises a brow, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Who are you, and how do you know my name? I’ve never seen you before.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I learn the names of those who draw the attention of chaos,”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> says in his normal dramatic way as he rubs his hands together, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I heard that you stood up to Xavier. I also heard that he wants to make life difficult for you, so I had to see for myself what made you so special.”</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "OC Zay",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Shinju",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Tired",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, you showed up at the right time.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> wipes the blood off of his lips. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Thanks for the save.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> nods slowly, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’ve decided…”</span> He lifts his chin, speaking solemnly, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You shall be my new minion.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“…What?”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You fought with strength and anger,”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> explains, sounding like the final boss giving their monologue. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You have the makings of a loyal minion. I will mold you into something greater! Together, we shall drag that stupid hero into darkness and despair!”</span> He gives an evil laugh. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> looks at you, then back at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>, and blinks. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Nah.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> stops and frowns, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“but whyyyy?!”</span> He asks, sounding defeated. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’m not really a minion type of guy.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> chuckles. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, how about a sidekick?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> <span style="Color: Pink">starts to sound a little desperate.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "OC Zay",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Smirk",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Shinju",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Smirk",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hmm… no, I don’t do sidekicks. It’s not a good color for me.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> laughs. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, well… What about my lack-”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> is interrupted by <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> extending his hand out. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“How about let’s just be friends?”</span> He asks. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> eyes the hand like it’s a trap, then slowly he reaches out and shakes it – like it’s the first time he’s done that in years. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“…Very well.”</span> He mutters, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“A fragile alliance – for now!”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sure,”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> smirks, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I can work with that.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> quickly releases his grip after the alliance is sealed and turns to walk towards the door. Just before he exits, he glances back <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“One day… you’ll understand the power of fear that we will have together! Until then, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> Miller… stay sharp.”</span> And then he’s gone. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> stares at the door for a moment before glancing to you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He’s kinda weird, no gonna lie.”</span> You shrug; he has no idea. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> shakes his head, a grin forming. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, I’m glad he wants me in his corner. I would hate to see what he does to his enemies.”</span> He chuckles, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You should go, I’m going to clean up in here before the janitor throws a fit. Really don’t want this getting back to my dad.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> pushes you out of the bathroom before you can refuse or offer to help. <br>

